#: kocrocrad.cpp:77
msgid "ocrad"
msgstr "ओक्र्याड"

#: kocrocrad.cpp:82
msgid ""
"ocrad is a Free Software project for optical character recognition."
"<p>The author of ocrad is <b>Antonio Diaz</b>"
"<br>For more information about ocrad see <A "
"HREF=\"http://www.gnu.org/software/ocrad/ocrad.html\">"
"http://www.gnu.org/software/ocrad/ocrad.html</A>"
"<p>Images should be scanned in black/white mode for ocrad."
"<br>Best results are achieved if the characters are at least 20 pixels high."
"<p>Problems arise, as usual, with very bold or very light or broken characters, "
"the same with merged character groups."
msgstr ""
"ओक्र्याड अप्टिकल क्यारेक्टर पहिचानका लागि स्वतन्त्र सफ्टवेयर योजना हो ।"
"<p>ओक्र्याडको लेखक <b>एन्टोनिओ डिआज हो</b>"
"<br>ओक्र्याडको बारेमा धेरै जानकारीका लागि <A "
"HREF=\"http://www.gnu.org/software/ocrad/ocrad.html\">"
"http://www.gnu.org/software/ocrad/ocrad.html</A> हेर्नुहोस्"
"<p>ओक्र्याडका लागि छविहरू कालो/सेतोमा स्क्यान गरिएको हुनुपर्छ ।"
"<br>यदि क्यारेक्टर कम्तिमा २० पिक्सेल भन्दा बढी भएमा उत्तम नतिजा प्राप्त "
"हुन्छन् ।"
